# Error Handling Rules for Invotek

## Error Handling Overview
Invotek uses a comprehensive error handling system with proper error models, handlers, and user-friendly messages in Arabic.

## Error Handling Structure
```
lib/core/error/
├── api_error_handler.dart (Main error handler)
├── error_model.dart (Error data model)
└── error_handler.dart (Error handling utilities)
```

